WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.900
Narrator: Not everyone has a radio - so we also use hand signals.

2
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.800
Narrator: Emergency: both arms crossed above your head, from the wrist.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.400
Narrator: Need supervisor: open and close your palm every three seconds, until your colleague answers with the same signal - copy.

4
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:25.400
Narrator: Area full, close entry: bump your fists together on top of your head, again and again.

5
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:34.200
Narrator: All clear, OK: one thumb up - and wait for the same sign back.

6
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.600
Narrator: Need relief or a break: make a T with your hands.

7
00:00:47.842 --> 00:01:05.004
Narrator: Release: both thumbs up, again and again. An area on hold or lock can open. All walkways open again. Open them slowly, under control, or crowds will build up.
